Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Peti-besi baharu: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault sulitkan: message kunci: key.
>> decrypted := vault nyahsulit: encrypted kunci: key.

Keluaran 
tulis: ['Message:'], baris-baharu
tulis: message, baris-baharu
tulis: ['Decrypted:'], baris-baharu
tulis: decrypted, baris-baharu.
